# Constitution

Non-negotiables for this Playwright project. Details live in `playwright-conventions.mdc`.

## MUST

| Rule | Standard |
|---|---|
| Locators | Role/label first; `data-testid` only as escape hatch |
| Waiting | Web-first assertions (`expect(locator)…`); never fixed sleeps |
| Auth | `storageState` via setup project; no inline login per test |
| Data | Unique per run (`Date.now()`, Faker); every test cleans up what it creates |
| Tags | Exactly one of `@smoke` `@sanity` `@regression` `@api` `@e2e` `@destructive`; never on `describe` |
| Destructive | `@destructive` only for shared/global mutations; serial + `afterEach`/`afterAll` revert |
| Reliability eval | Refresh **Current report** in `.cursor/skills/eval-report/SKILL.md` before orchestrator Done |

## SHOULD

| Rule | Standard |
|---|---|
| Factories | Faker for generated test data |
| Enums | Shared enums for repeated UI/API strings |
| POM docs | JSDoc on public action methods in page objects |

## WON'T

| Rule | Why |
|---|---|
| XPath / CSS selectors | Coupled to markup; use user-facing locators |
| `waitForTimeout` | Masks missing wait conditions |
| Hardcoded secrets | Use `process.env` |
| `any` | Type fixtures, POMs, and helpers properly |
| Weakened assertions | Fix product, test intent, or file a bug — never delete/skip to go green |
| Heal a real bug | Triage first; real defects → Jira, not locator patches |
| Tags on `describe` | One tag per test only |

## Agent governance

Behavioral contract (not hook-enforced). **Audit, then edit** — explore enough to know the real path/enum/env/message before changing files.

### Proposal (required before non-trivial edits)

Emit this block, then wait for the confidence gate:

```text
Proposal
- Scope: <what will change / not change>
- Confidence: <1–10>
- Rationale: <why this approach>
- Unknowns: <gaps, assumptions, missing inputs>
```

### Confidence gate

| Score | Action |
|---|---|
| **&lt; 5** | Do **not** proceed — ask for the missing input |
| **5–7** | Proceed only with **explicit Unknowns** and **human approval** |
| **≥ 8** | Proceed |

### Never invent

Do not invent a **path**, **enum**, **env var**, **credential**, or **UI/API message**. Ask the human or explore the repo/app instead.

## Skills & agents

**Skills:** `api-cleanup` — test teardown; `ci-failure-triage` — red-run diagnosis; `didaxis-program-deleter` — bulk program delete; `explore-and-generate` — find untested flows; `exploratory-charter` — feature+risk → charter/findings format; `jira-bug-reporter` — file defects; `jira-ticket-analyzer` — AC → Gherkin; `pom-conventions` — page object rules; `eval-report` — refresh flake/heal/generation/ask metrics; `self-heal` — fix drifted locators (test issues only).

**Agents:** `triage` — classify CI failures; `bug-reporter` — Jira bug from confirmed defect; `test-writer` — plan → Playwright spec.
